[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":1359},["ShallowReactive",2],{"docs-page-fr-\u002Finstallation":3,"docs-nav-fr":217},{"id":4,"title":5,"body":6,"description":210,"extension":211,"meta":212,"navigation":213,"order":174,"path":214,"seo":215,"stem":12,"__hash__":216},"content_fr\u002Finstallation.md","Installation",{"type":7,"value":8,"toc":203},"minimark",[9,13,30,35,56,59,63,77,80,84,109,120,124,131,135,150,183,199],[10,11,5],"h1",{"id":12},"installation",[14,15,16,17,22,23,29],"p",{},"Récupère un build sur la ",[18,19,21],"a",{"href":20},"\u002Fdownload","page Télécharger"," ou sur ",[18,24,28],{"href":25,"rel":26},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002FSoundNinja\u002Freleases\u002Flatest",[27],"nofollow","GitHub Releases",". SoundNinja est en développement précoce — traite les builds comme des bêtas.",[31,32,34],"h2",{"id":33},"windows","Windows",[36,37,38,50,53],"ul",{},[39,40,41,45,46,49],"li",{},[42,43,44],"strong",{},"Installateur (.exe)"," ou ",[42,47,48],{},"MSI (.msi)"," pour Windows 64 bits",[39,51,52],{},"Cible de la landing page : Windows 10 et plus",[39,54,55],{},"Le README de l’app mentionne aussi Windows 8 et supérieur",[14,57,58],{},"Lance l’installateur, puis ouvre SoundNinja depuis le menu Démarrer.",[31,60,62],{"id":61},"macos","macOS",[36,64,65,71,74],{},[39,66,67,70],{},[42,68,69],{},".dmg universel"," pour Apple Silicon et Intel",[39,72,73],{},"Cible de la landing page : macOS 10.14 et plus",[39,75,76],{},"Le README de l’app mentionne macOS 10.15 et supérieur",[14,78,79],{},"Ouvre l’image disque et glisse SoundNinja dans Applications.",[31,81,83],{"id":82},"linux","Linux",[36,85,86,92,98,106],{},[39,87,88,91],{},[42,89,90],{},"Debian (.deb)"," pour Ubuntu \u002F Debian",[39,93,94,97],{},[42,95,96],{},"AppImage"," pour les autres distros",[39,99,100,101,105],{},"Après publication d’une release, les utilisateurs Arch peuvent installer ",[102,103,104],"code",{},"soundninja-bin"," depuis l’AUR",[39,107,108],{},"Testé sur Ubuntu 20.04",[14,110,111,112,115,116,119],{},"Les builds desktop ont besoin des paquets WebKit et GTK. Sous Debian\u002FUbuntu, ça veut souvent dire ",[102,113,114],{},"libwebkit2gtk",", ",[102,117,118],{},"libgtk-3-0"," et une bibliothèque app-indicator.",[31,121,123],{"id":122},"mises-à-jour","Mises à jour",[14,125,126,127,130],{},"Dans l’app, ouvre ",[42,128,129],{},"Aide → Rechercher les mises à jour",". Tu peux aussi laisser SoundNinja vérifier au démarrage dans les Paramètres.",[31,132,134],{"id":133},"compiler-depuis-les-sources","Compiler depuis les sources",[14,136,137,138,143,144,149],{},"Besoin d’un build custom ? Clone ",[18,139,142],{"href":140,"rel":141},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002FSoundNinja",[27],"le repo",", installe les ",[18,145,148],{"href":146,"rel":147},"https:\u002F\u002Fv2.tauri.app\u002Fstart\u002Fprerequisites\u002F",[27],"prérequis Tauri",", puis :",[151,152,157],"pre",{"className":153,"code":154,"language":155,"meta":156,"style":156},"language-bash shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark","bun install\nbun run tauri:serve\n","bash","",[102,158,159,172],{"__ignoreMap":156},[160,161,164,168],"span",{"class":162,"line":163},"line",1,[160,165,167],{"class":166},"sScJk","bun",[160,169,171],{"class":170},"sZZnC"," install\n",[160,173,175,177,180],{"class":162,"line":174},2,[160,176,167],{"class":166},[160,178,179],{"class":170}," run",[160,181,182],{"class":170}," tauri:serve\n",[14,184,185,115,188,45,191,194,195,198],{},[102,186,187],{},"npm",[102,189,190],{},"pnpm",[102,192,193],{},"deno"," marchent aussi. Build de production : ",[102,196,197],{},"bun run tauri:build",".",[200,201,202],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .sScJk, html code.shiki .sScJk{--shiki-default:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0}html pre.shiki code .sZZnC, html code.shiki .sZZnC{--shiki-default:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF}html .default .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-default);background: var(--shiki-default-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-default-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-default-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-default-text-decoration);}html .dark .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-dark);background: var(--shiki-dark-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-dark-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-dark-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-dark-text-decoration);}html.dark .shiki span {color: var(--shiki-dark);background: var(--shiki-dark-bg);font-style: var(--shiki-dark-font-style);font-weight: var(--shiki-dark-font-weight);text-decoration: var(--shiki-dark-text-decoration);}",{"title":156,"searchDepth":174,"depth":174,"links":204},[205,206,207,208,209],{"id":33,"depth":174,"text":34},{"id":61,"depth":174,"text":62},{"id":82,"depth":174,"text":83},{"id":122,"depth":174,"text":123},{"id":133,"depth":174,"text":134},"Installe SoundNinja sur Windows, macOS ou Linux.","md",{},true,"\u002Finstallation",{"title":5,"description":210},"pbEgfObzQ57hJHQ_Y3qGhgX0zLihiW_l6ZrgNA2lCO8",[218,337,458,606,761,897,1040,1262],{"id":219,"title":220,"body":221,"description":331,"extension":211,"meta":332,"navigation":213,"order":163,"path":333,"seo":334,"stem":335,"__hash__":336},"content_fr\u002Foverview.md","Aperçu",{"type":7,"value":222,"toc":325},[223,226,229,232,235,239,253,257,287,291,300,304],[10,224,220],{"id":225},"aperçu",[14,227,228],{},"SoundNinja est un soundboard open source pour le live streaming, les discussions entre amis et l’enregistrement de podcasts. Il est construit avec Tauri v2 et Nuxt 4 pour rester léger en RAM et sur le disque.",[14,230,231],{},"Le but est simple : garder une énorme bibliothèque de sons facile à parcourir, puis jouer le bon clip en quelques millisecondes. L’interface marche aussi comme tableau de bord en VR.",[14,233,234],{},"SoundNinja est encore en développement précoce. Les fonctions marchent, mais toutes les plateformes ne sont pas entièrement testées.",[31,236,238],{"id":237},"pour-qui","Pour qui",[36,240,241,244,247,250],{},[39,242,243],{},"Les streameurs qui ont besoin de cues sonores instantanés",[39,245,246],{},"Les amis qui veulent un board partagé pour le vocal",[39,248,249],{},"Les podcasteurs qui enregistrent des clips et les posent sur un board",[39,251,252],{},"Quiconque veut un soundboard personnalisable et local-first",[31,254,256],{"id":255},"ce-que-tu-peux-faire","Ce que tu peux faire",[36,258,259,262,265,268,271,274,281,284],{},[39,260,261],{},"Construire un soundboard à partir de tes propres fichiers audio",[39,263,264],{},"Organiser les sons dans des onglets colorés, des groupes et la recherche",[39,266,267],{},"Concevoir le look avec le Theme Creator",[39,269,270],{},"Enregistrer l’audio du PC ou un micro dans le Record Editor",[39,272,273],{},"Assigner des raccourcis à des sons individuels",[39,275,276,277],{},"Déclencher des sons depuis ",[18,278,280],{"href":279},"\u002Fdocs\u002Fremote-control","Bitfocus Companion",[39,282,283],{},"Importer et exporter un soundboard complet pour le partager",[39,285,286],{},"Utiliser des GIF ou des images sur les boutons de son",[31,288,290],{"id":289},"licence","Licence",[14,292,293,294,299],{},"SoundNinja est un logiciel libre sous ",[18,295,298],{"href":296,"rel":297},"https:\u002F\u002Fgithub.com\u002Fmarcus-universe\u002FSoundNinja\u002Fblob\u002Fmain\u002FLICENSE",[27],"GPL-3.0",". Forke-le, modifie-le, partage-le.",[31,301,303],{"id":302},"prochaines-étapes","Prochaines étapes",[305,306,307,313,319],"ol",{},[39,308,309],{},[18,310,312],{"href":311},"\u002Fdocs\u002Finstallation","Installer SoundNinja",[39,314,315],{},[18,316,318],{"href":317},"\u002Fdocs\u002Fadding-sounds","Ajouter des sons",[39,320,321],{},[18,322,324],{"href":323},"\u002Fdocs\u002Forganizing-sounds","Organiser ton board",{"title":156,"searchDepth":174,"depth":174,"links":326},[327,328,329,330],{"id":237,"depth":174,"text":238},{"id":255,"depth":174,"text":256},{"id":289,"depth":174,"text":290},{"id":302,"depth":174,"text":303},"Ce qu’est SoundNinja et ce que tu peux en faire.",{},"\u002Foverview",{"title":220,"description":331},"overview","ZY8wtO0KcJ2GGKh9NDik0dGVB6QXrk3FQ-5mCb0D4-8",{"id":4,"title":5,"body":338,"description":210,"extension":211,"meta":456,"navigation":213,"order":174,"path":214,"seo":457,"stem":12,"__hash__":216},{"type":7,"value":339,"toc":449},[340,342,349,351,363,365,367,377,379,381,397,403,405,409,411,419,437,447],[10,341,5],{"id":12},[14,343,16,344,22,346,29],{},[18,345,21],{"href":20},[18,347,28],{"href":25,"rel":348},[27],[31,350,34],{"id":33},[36,352,353,359,361],{},[39,354,355,45,357,49],{},[42,356,44],{},[42,358,48],{},[39,360,52],{},[39,362,55],{},[14,364,58],{},[31,366,62],{"id":61},[36,368,369,373,375],{},[39,370,371,70],{},[42,372,69],{},[39,374,73],{},[39,376,76],{},[14,378,79],{},[31,380,83],{"id":82},[36,382,383,387,391,395],{},[39,384,385,91],{},[42,386,90],{},[39,388,389,97],{},[42,390,96],{},[39,392,100,393,105],{},[102,394,104],{},[39,396,108],{},[14,398,111,399,115,401,119],{},[102,400,114],{},[102,402,118],{},[31,404,123],{"id":122},[14,406,126,407,130],{},[42,408,129],{},[31,410,134],{"id":133},[14,412,137,413,143,416,149],{},[18,414,142],{"href":140,"rel":415},[27],[18,417,148],{"href":146,"rel":418},[27],[151,420,421],{"className":153,"code":154,"language":155,"meta":156,"style":156},[102,422,423,429],{"__ignoreMap":156},[160,424,425,427],{"class":162,"line":163},[160,426,167],{"class":166},[160,428,171],{"class":170},[160,430,431,433,435],{"class":162,"line":174},[160,432,167],{"class":166},[160,434,179],{"class":170},[160,436,182],{"class":170},[14,438,439,115,441,45,443,194,445,198],{},[102,440,187],{},[102,442,190],{},[102,444,193],{},[102,446,197],{},[200,448,202],{},{"title":156,"searchDepth":174,"depth":174,"links":450},[451,452,453,454,455],{"id":33,"depth":174,"text":34},{"id":61,"depth":174,"text":62},{"id":82,"depth":174,"text":83},{"id":122,"depth":174,"text":123},{"id":133,"depth":174,"text":134},{},{"title":5,"description":210},{"id":459,"title":318,"body":460,"description":599,"extension":211,"meta":600,"navigation":213,"order":601,"path":602,"seo":603,"stem":604,"__hash__":605},"content_fr\u002Fadding-sounds.md",{"type":7,"value":461,"toc":591},[462,465,468,472,491,495,526,530,549,553,567,570,574,581,585],[10,463,318],{"id":464},"ajouter-des-sons",[14,466,467],{},"Un board reste vide tant que tu n’ajoutes pas de clips. SoundNinja peut importer des fichiers, des dossiers entiers, un enregistrement ou un pack de soundboard partagé.",[31,469,471],{"id":470},"importer-des-fichiers-audio","Importer des fichiers audio",[305,473,474,485,488],{},[39,475,476,477,480,481,484],{},"Ouvre ",[42,478,479],{},"Fichier → Importer des fichiers audio",", ou utilise ",[42,482,483],{},"Importer"," dans la barre de navigation.",[39,486,487],{},"Choisis un ou plusieurs fichiers audio.",[39,489,490],{},"Les sons arrivent dans l’onglet actuel.",[31,492,494],{"id":493},"importer-des-dossiers","Importer des dossiers",[305,496,497,506,509],{},[39,498,476,499,502,503,505],{},[42,500,501],{},"Fichier → Importer des dossiers"," (ou ",[42,504,494],{}," dans la barre de navigation).",[39,507,508],{},"Ajoute un ou plusieurs dossiers. Glisse pour les réordonner avant l’import.",[39,510,511,512],{},"Choisis comment ils arrivent :\n",[36,513,514,520],{},[39,515,516,519],{},[42,517,518],{},"Importer comme onglets"," — chaque dossier devient son propre onglet",[39,521,522,525],{},[42,523,524],{},"Importer dans l’onglet actuel"," — chaque fichier va dans l’onglet actif",[31,527,529],{"id":528},"enregistrer-un-clip","Enregistrer un clip",[14,531,532,533,537,538,541,542,45,545,548],{},"Ouvre le ",[18,534,536],{"href":535},"\u002Fdocs\u002Frecording-editor","Record Editor"," depuis le bouton ",[42,539,540],{},"Enregistrer"," dans la barre du lecteur. Capture, coupe, puis ",[42,543,544],{},"Importer la sélection",[42,546,547],{},"Tout importer"," dans l’onglet actuel ou un onglet que tu choisis.",[31,550,552],{"id":551},"importer-un-soundboard","Importer un soundboard",[14,554,555,558,559,562,563,566],{},[42,556,557],{},"Fichier → Importer un soundboard"," charge un pack partagé. Les packs sont un ",[102,560,561],{},".zip"," qui contient ",[102,564,565],{},"project.sninja"," plus les fichiers audio. Après l’import, ouvre le projet et joue.",[14,568,569],{},"Tu peux aussi garder plusieurs projets (profils). Utilise le sélecteur de projet pour changer de board.",[31,571,573],{"id":572},"relier-les-fichiers-manquants","Relier les fichiers manquants",[14,575,576,577,580],{},"Si des fichiers audio bougent sur le disque, SoundNinja affiche ",[42,578,579],{},"Fichiers audio manquants",". Choisis un dossier à parcourir et relie les clips.",[31,582,584],{"id":583},"suite","Suite",[14,586,587,588,198],{},"Organise onglets, groupes et raccourcis dans ",[18,589,590],{"href":323},"Organiser les sons",{"title":156,"searchDepth":174,"depth":174,"links":592},[593,594,595,596,597,598],{"id":470,"depth":174,"text":471},{"id":493,"depth":174,"text":494},{"id":528,"depth":174,"text":529},{"id":551,"depth":174,"text":552},{"id":572,"depth":174,"text":573},{"id":583,"depth":174,"text":584},"Importe de l’audio, des dossiers, des enregistrements et des soundboards partagés.",{},3,"\u002Fadding-sounds",{"title":318,"description":599},"adding-sounds","WxjyAOY51Jh80jxw4Xvj7Ko_IY_wVuHJST0KFUWSZ9k",{"id":607,"title":590,"body":608,"description":754,"extension":211,"meta":755,"navigation":213,"order":756,"path":757,"seo":758,"stem":759,"__hash__":760},"content_fr\u002Forganizing-sounds.md",{"type":7,"value":609,"toc":745},[610,613,616,620,647,654,658,661,675,682,686,692,696,707,711,714,718,721,727,733,737],[10,611,590],{"id":612},"organiser-les-sons",[14,614,615],{},"SoundNinja est conçu pour les grandes bibliothèques. Utilise les onglets, les groupes, la recherche et les raccourcis pour que le clip dont tu as besoin soit à un clic (ou une touche) près.",[31,617,619],{"id":618},"onglets","Onglets",[36,621,622,629,636],{},[39,623,624,625,628],{},"Ajoute un onglet avec ",[42,626,627],{},"Ajouter un onglet",". Donne-lui une couleur pour scanner la barre vite.",[39,630,631,632,635],{},"La vue ",[42,633,634],{},"Tous"," montre chaque son à travers les onglets.",[39,637,638,639,642,643,646],{},"Un son peut appartenir à ",[42,640,641],{},"un ou plusieurs onglets",". Clic droit sur un son et utilise ",[42,644,645],{},"Déplacer vers l’onglet"," pour l’assigner.",[14,648,649,650,653],{},"Les transitions d’onglets sont dans ",[42,651,652],{},"Paramètres → Général"," : Slide, Fade, Boutons un par un, ou Aucune.",[31,655,657],{"id":656},"groupes","Groupes",[14,659,660],{},"Depuis la v0.5.3, les séparateurs peuvent devenir des groupes nommés :",[36,662,663,666,669,672],{},[39,664,665],{},"Ajouter, renommer ou supprimer un groupe depuis le menu contextuel",[39,667,668],{},"Glisser l’en-tête du groupe — les enfants suivent",[39,670,671],{},"Déposer des sons dans un groupe ou les en sortir",[39,673,674],{},"Régler la couleur de bordure, la couleur du nom et l’alignement des boutons (ou utiliser le défaut de l’onglet)",[14,676,677,678,681],{},"Tu peux toujours ajouter un ",[42,679,680],{},"Séparateur"," simple si tu as seulement besoin d’une coupure visuelle.",[31,683,685],{"id":684},"recherche","Recherche",[14,687,688,689,691],{},"Utilise le champ ",[42,690,685],{}," dans la barre de navigation. Les résultats se mettent à jour pendant que tu tapes.",[31,693,695],{"id":694},"réordonner","Réordonner",[14,697,698,699,702,703,706],{},"Active le glisser-déposer dans ",[42,700,701],{},"Paramètres → Comportement"," (",[42,704,705],{},"Autoriser le réordonnancement","). Puis glisse sons et groupes en place.",[31,708,710],{"id":709},"édition-groupée","Édition groupée",[14,712,713],{},"Sélectionne plusieurs sons, puis change la couleur, déplace-les vers un onglet ou supprime-les en une étape.",[31,715,717],{"id":716},"raccourcis-et-ids-de-son","Raccourcis et IDs de son",[14,719,720],{},"Chaque son a un ID de 8 caractères. Copie-le depuis le menu contextuel du bouton ou la puce d’ID de la sélection multiple.",[14,722,476,723,726],{},[42,724,725],{},"Paramètres → Raccourcis"," pour lier une touche à un ID de son. Les raccourcis globaux sont optionnels.",[14,728,729,730,732],{},"Le même ID est ce que ",[18,731,280],{"href":279}," utilise pour déclencher un clip.",[31,734,736],{"id":735},"gifs-et-couleurs","GIFs et couleurs",[14,738,739,740,744],{},"Clic droit sur un son pour régler des couleurs par bouton ou un fond GIF \u002F image. C’est séparé du ",[18,741,743],{"href":742},"\u002Fdocs\u002Ftheme-editor","Theme Creator",", qui habille tout le board.",{"title":156,"searchDepth":174,"depth":174,"links":746},[747,748,749,750,751,752,753],{"id":618,"depth":174,"text":619},{"id":656,"depth":174,"text":657},{"id":684,"depth":174,"text":685},{"id":694,"depth":174,"text":695},{"id":709,"depth":174,"text":710},{"id":716,"depth":174,"text":717},{"id":735,"depth":174,"text":736},"Onglets, groupes, recherche, édition groupée et raccourcis.",{},4,"\u002Forganizing-sounds",{"title":590,"description":754},"organizing-sounds","s3oaYG46DStsSAtCx2-Sgrn_LoxScaKkOmEWwKlXmKQ",{"id":762,"title":763,"body":764,"description":890,"extension":211,"meta":891,"navigation":213,"order":892,"path":893,"seo":894,"stem":895,"__hash__":896},"content_fr\u002Ftheme-editor.md","Éditeur de thème",{"type":7,"value":765,"toc":884},[766,769,775,779,806,809,813,827,831,857,860,864,870],[10,767,763],{"id":768},"éditeur-de-thème",[14,770,771,772,198],{},"Le Theme Creator est l’éditeur visuel complet de ton board. Ouvre-le depuis ",[42,773,774],{},"Paramètres → Général → Theme Creator",[31,776,778],{"id":777},"trois-onglets","Trois onglets",[305,780,781,795,801],{},[39,782,783,786,787,790,791,794],{},[42,784,785],{},"Général"," — nom du thème, couleurs partagées et import de polices (",[102,788,789],{},".ttf"," \u002F ",[102,792,793],{},".otf",")",[39,796,797,800],{},[42,798,799],{},"Boutons"," — couleurs, typo, disposition et overlay GIF des boutons de son",[39,802,803,805],{},[42,804,619],{}," — couleurs, typo et épaisseur de bordure de la barre d’onglets",[14,807,808],{},"Un aperçu en direct montre onglets et boutons pendant que tu édites.",[31,810,812],{"id":811},"ce-que-tu-peux-changer","Ce que tu peux changer",[36,814,815,818,821,824],{},[39,816,817],{},"Couleurs primaire et d’accent, fonds, couleurs des boutons, couleurs des onglets",[39,819,820],{},"Famille et taille de police des boutons et des onglets",[39,822,823],{},"Largeur, rayon, bordure, écarts et padding des boutons",[39,825,826],{},"Opacité de l’overlay GIF (normal et survol)",[31,828,830],{"id":829},"enregistrer-et-partager","Enregistrer et partager",[36,832,833,839,845,851],{},[39,834,835,838],{},[42,836,837],{},"Exporter .css"," — écrire un fichier de thème à sauvegarder ou envoyer à un ami",[39,840,841,844],{},[42,842,843],{},"Ajouter aux thèmes"," — enregistrer le fichier dans ton dossier Themes et l’appliquer",[39,846,847,850],{},[42,848,849],{},"Importer .css"," — charger un preset intégré ou un thème enregistré",[39,852,853,856],{},[42,854,855],{},"Réinitialiser"," — revenir aux défauts SoundNinja",[14,858,859],{},"Si tu fermes la fenêtre avec des changements non enregistrés, SoundNinja te demande d’enregistrer d’abord.",[31,861,863],{"id":862},"sans-léditeur-complet","Sans l’éditeur complet",[14,865,866,867,869],{},"Dans ",[42,868,652],{}," tu peux toujours :",[36,871,872,875,881],{},[39,873,874],{},"Choisir un thème dans la liste",[39,876,877,878,794],{},"Éditer les variables CSS en direct (",[42,879,880],{},"CSS personnalisé",[39,882,883],{},"Importer un fichier de thème dans le dossier Themes",{"title":156,"searchDepth":174,"depth":174,"links":885},[886,887,888,889],{"id":777,"depth":174,"text":778},{"id":811,"depth":174,"text":812},{"id":829,"depth":174,"text":830},{